    "b-00-overview-the-package-has-a-produc-28": {
      "id": "b-00-overview-the-package-has-a-produc-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The package has a production-shaped vertical slice: it can initialize a run,\nqueue fixture targets, run a dry-run scheduler tick, lease one worker target,\nwrite reports, recover interrupted leases, run a global regression-check\nwrapper, run the deterministic run loop, and run a guardian wrapper around that\nloop. The run loop handles durable events with the scheduler, fills worker slots\nfrom queued work, and rests when the board is quiet. The guardian wrapper wakes on\nprocess-health incidents and restarts the decomp system process when policy\nallows. PR refresh and end-to-end score integration remain explicit operator\nsteps."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
